{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01URtsTL1RXJpKCzTXuXyU1o","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6c351867-3c9c-4124-beb4-0ae84097512a","uuid":"a1126b2b-ceb2-4a42-aff2-4186e41b1daa","timestamp":"2026-06-10T09:13:04.410Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","oldString":"- **sos_257:** `ManaPool` models exactly one restriction kind","newString":"- **sos_57:** \"your next main phase\" is implemented as your next *precombat*\n  main (E2 only fires there, per the plan). If Mana Sculpt resolves during\n  your own turn before/during combat, a strict reading would let the mana\n  arrive at that turn's postcombat main; here it arrives at your next\n  precombat main instead. Deliberate plan-scoped simplification.\n- **sos_57:** added `card.mana_spent` (total paid; 0 for free casts) to the\n  casting pipeline, mirroring `colors_spent` — the engine recorded colors\n  but not the amount.\n- **sos_257:** `ManaPool` models exactly one restriction kind","originalFile":"# Key decisions log\n\n- **E1:** Fired `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` from `cast_spell_free` as well as\n  `cast_spell` — casting without paying the cost is still casting (rule 601),\n  so cast-watching abilities (e.g. Casualty, the sos_257 pump) must see free\n  casts. Copies pushed via `copy_spell` still fire nothing, as planned.\n- **sos_1:** The plan's replacement seam couldn't work as written — the engine\n  only consulted replacement effects for battlefield→graveyard moves, and\n  `AttacksTriggeredEvent` was never fired. Added two additive engine edits:\n  fire attack triggers at the end of `declare_attackers_step`, and pass a new\n  `SpellPutIntoGraveyardReplacementEvent` from `_resolve_spell` (gate in\n  `move_to_zone` relaxed to \"whenever the caller supplies an event\").\n  Limitation (commented): a spell countered via a card-local `_counter_spell`\n  is added to the graveyard directly, bypassing the exile-instead replacement.\n- **sos_1:** \"may cast target …\" — with exactly one legal card the trigger\n  auto-selects it without prompting (per TODO); with several, `choose_card`\n  returning `None` declines.\n- **Ability activation in tests:** the workspace has no `ActivateAbility`\n  helper (despite the run instructions naming one); the engine's real\n  activation path is `engine.abilities.activate_ability` with an\n  `ActivatedAbilityInstance`/`LoyaltyAbilityInstance` built from the card's\n  printed ability list (by index). Tests use small local wrappers around\n  that path and resolve non-mana abilities off the stack via `resolve_top`.\n- **sos_257:** `ManaPool` models exactly one restriction kind\n  (\"instant_or_sorcery\"), spent restricted-first within a mana type; the\n  pool's `total()`/`get()` stay unrestricted-only so FDN cards' cost checks\n  can't see unusable mana. The {5} animation is permanent, so it is baked\n  into `_original_card_types` rather than modeled as a continuous effect.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":21,"oldLines":6,"newStart":21,"newLines":14,"lines":["   `ActivatedAbilityInstance`/`LoyaltyAbilityInstance` built from the card's","   printed ability list (by index). Tests use small local wrappers around","   that path and resolve non-mana abilities off the stack via `resolve_top`.","+- **sos_57:** \"your next main phase\" is implemented as your next *precombat*","+  main (E2 only fires there, per the plan). If Mana Sculpt resolves during","+  your own turn before/during combat, a strict reading would let the mana","+  arrive at that turn's postcombat main; here it arrives at your next","+  precombat main instead. Deliberate plan-scoped simplification.","+- **sos_57:** added `card.mana_spent` (total paid; 0 for free casts) to the","+  casting pipeline, mirroring `colors_spent` — the engine recorded colors","+  but not the amount."," - **sos_257:** `ManaPool` models exactly one restriction kind","   (\"instant_or_sorcery\"), spent restricted-first within a mana type; the","   pool's `total()`/`get()` stay unrestricted-only so FDN cards' cost checks"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
